      "title": "Lua: DissectorTable_try don't call data dissector",
      "message": "Lua: DissectorTable_try don't call data dissector\n\nRemove `call_data_dissector()` from Lua `DissectorTable_try()` function.\nThis way it can return 0 as documented when no dissector table matches.\n\nRemove `bool handled` which was only being used to decide whether to\nmake the now-removed function call.\n",
